<div class="sn-about">
  <section class="sn-about__lead" aria-labelledby="AboutLead-{{ section_id }}">
    <div class="sn-about__lead-copy">
      <p class="sn-about__eyebrow">Power for real life</p>
      <h2 id="AboutLead-{{ section_id }}">Energy choices should feel clear.</h2>
      <p class="sn-about__lede">
        SuntNeew brings practical power solutions to the road, the driveway, and the home. Our range spans LiFePO4 RV
        batteries, portable jump starters, and home energy storage systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        Across every category, we focus on useful product information, application fit, and a straightforward path to
        support, so you can choose around the way you actually use power.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="sn-about__lead-media">
      <img
        src="{{ 'suntneew-rv-g31-feature-lifestyle-desktop.jpg' | asset_url }}"
        alt="SuntNeew RV battery supporting a lakeside motorhome trip"
        width="2400"
        height="1200"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      >
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="sn-about__principles" aria-labelledby="AboutPrinciples-{{ section_id }}">
    <header class="sn-about__section-heading">
      <p class="sn-about__eyebrow">How we think</p>
      <h2 id="AboutPrinciples-{{ section_id }}">Start with the job. Then choose the power.</h2>
      <p>
        A better decision begins with the real constraint: physical fit, usable energy, output, system compatibility,
        or the kind of emergency you are preparing for.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="sn-about__principle-grid">
      <article>
        <span aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>Clarity before checkout</h3>
        <p>We organize choices around specifications and use cases that help customers compare the right details.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>Built around real use</h3>
        <p>Road travel, roadside readiness, and home energy each call for a different starting point.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h3>Support beyond the product page</h3>
        <p>Guidance, product documentation, and direct support remain part of the experience after purchase.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sn-about__range" aria-labelledby="AboutRange-{{ section_id }}">
    <header class="sn-about__section-heading">
      <p class="sn-about__eyebrow">One brand, three power paths</p>
      <h2 id="AboutRange-{{ section_id }}">Meet SuntNeew where energy matters.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="sn-about__range-grid">
      <a class="sn-about__range-item" href="{{ collections['rv-batteries'].url }}">
        <span class="sn-about__range-media">
          <img
            src="{{ 'suntneew-rv-g31-feature-lifestyle-desktop.jpg' | asset_url }}"
            alt="Motorhome powered by a SuntNeew RV battery"
            width="2400"
            height="1200"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        </span>
        <span class="sn-about__range-copy">
          <span class="sn-about__eyebrow">RV batteries</span>
          <strong>Power for time off-grid</strong>
          <span>Compare case fit, capacity, and continuous output for the way your RV is used.</span>
          <span class="sn-about__text-link">Explore RV batteries</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a class="sn-about__range-item" href="{{ collections['jump-starters'].url }}">
        <span class="sn-about__range-media">
          <img
            src="{{ 'suntneew-use-jump.jpg' | asset_url }}"
            alt="SuntNeew portable jump starter connected in an engine bay"
            width="1200"
            height="1400"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        </span>
        <span class="sn-about__range-copy">
          <span class="sn-about__eyebrow">Jump starters</span>
          <strong>Readiness when plans change</strong>
          <span>Choose portable starting power around vehicle fit, starting current, and everyday carry needs.</span>
          <span class="sn-about__text-link">Explore jump starters</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a class="sn-about__range-item" href="{{ collections['home-energy-storage'].url }}">
        <span class="sn-about__range-media">
          <img
            src="{{ 'suntneew-use-home-energy.jpg' | asset_url }}"
            alt="SuntNeew home energy storage systems beside a solar-powered home"
            width="1921"
            height="1080"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        </span>
        <span class="sn-about__range-copy">
          <span class="sn-about__eyebrow">Home energy storage</span>
          <strong>Storage planned as a system</strong>
          <span>Begin with energy needs, inverter compatibility, site conditions, and the installation plan.</span>
          <span class="sn-about__text-link">Explore home energy</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sn-about__cta" aria-labelledby="AboutCta-{{ section_id }}">
    <div>
      <p class="sn-about__eyebrow">Your next step</p>
      <h2 id="AboutCta-{{ section_id }}">Find the right starting point.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sn-about__actions">
      <a class="sn-about__button" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Browse all products</a>
      <a class="sn-about__button sn-about__button--secondary" href="/pages/contact-us">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
